# Issue #15, box 3: SSH through an AWS IoT secure tunnel, LAN proof, 2026-11-21 (UTC)
#
# Source end: localproxy v3.3.1 built in WSL on the PC (192.168.0.122). Destination: the
# device client running from /tmp on the gateway. SSH host key checked against the gateway's
# own key (HostKeyAlias=192.168.0.103, StrictHostKeyChecking=yes). Tokens, account number and
# endpoint are not in this file. Two tunnels opened, $1.00 each.
# Script: open-tunnel, localproxy -s 5555, three ssh logins, close-tunnel.

